---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Garage Door Services
permalink: /services/
description: "Full-service garage door repair and installation in Central Florida — broken springs, opener repair, new door installation, cables, rollers, and tune-ups. Free estimates."
---

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Services</span>
      </nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>
      <h1>Garage Door Services in {{ site.areaServed }}</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Whatever your garage door needs — a quick fix, a worn-out part, or a complete new installation — our local team has it covered. Every job comes with a free estimate and upfront pricing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-detail-grid">
        {%- for s in services.list %}
        <article class="service-detail-card" id="{{ s.slug }}">
          <div class="service-detail-top">
            <span class="service-detail-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.icon }}</span>
            <span class="service-detail-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          </div>
          <h2>{{ s.name }}</h2>
          <p>{{ s.body }}</p>
          <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="btn btn--outline">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        </article>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        <h3>Not sure what's wrong with your door?</h3>
        <p>That's what we're here for. Call us and describe what's happening — most of the time we can tell you what it likely is and give a ballpark before we ever roll a truck.</p>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
